	(layer "F.Cu")
	(descr "RGB LED PLCC-6, 5.0x5.0x1.6mm body, three independent dies, land pattern from LED_SMD:LED_RGB_5050-6. Pads are renumbered to the LED_RGB_BASE symbol order (1 R cathode, 2 G cathode, 3 B cathode, 4 B anode, 5 G anode, 6 R anode), which is NOT the manufacturer pin numbering: XL-5050RGBC pin 1 = B cathode, 2 = R cathode, 3 = G cathode, 4 = G anode, 5 = R anode, 6 = B anode. Placed with the package chamfer at the top left, so the cathodes sit on the left. https://www.lcsc.com/product-detail/C2843868.html")
